{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An island made of candy sounds like paradise \u2013 but for the residents of Sarkara, fabled to be the home of the legendary Serenity Sweet, devastating earthquakes are threatening the resident\u2019s idyllic way of life!\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >YOU are an investigator sent to Sarkara to uncover what\u2019s threatening the island \u2013 and all of reality as we know it.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > ~ ~\u00a0Dress up in found objects. Reinvent yourself! ~ ~\u00a0</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You have lost all your stuff in a disastrous crash. Re-equip yourself with any item you find, from a doll\u2019s lost arm to a floaty feather. All can affect your dialogue skill checks and minigame moves. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2269360/extras/07b34ab87ef7b902431c9aa1f95df3ac.poster.avif?t=1758676154\" width=476 height=476 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2269360/extras/07b34ab87ef7b902431c9aa1f95df3ac.webm?t=1758676154\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2269360/extras/07b34ab87ef7b902431c9aa1f95df3ac.mp4?t=1758676154\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > ~ ~\u00a0Make friends with weirdos ~ ~\u00a0</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Get involved in local politics \u2013 or maybe accidentally join a cult. You'll have to form alliances and make enemies to get to the bottom of the mystery.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2269360/extras/931d7c91835d3ad705448c8c433b9e31.poster.avif?t=1758676154\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2269360/extras/931d7c91835d3ad705448c8c433b9e31.webm?t=1758676154\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2269360/extras/931d7c91835d3ad705448c8c433b9e31.mp4?t=1758676154\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > ~ ~\u00a0Get into various altercations ~ ~\u00a0</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When dialogue is not enough, settle disputes in minigames. Find limbs and candy that grant special moves to sway conflict in your favor.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2269360/extras/8aab65fbfe2a3e6eeaf9c7dc1d50d0f8.poster.avif?t=1758676154\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2269360/extras/8aab65fbfe2a3e6eeaf9c7dc1d50d0f8.webm?t=1758676154\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2269360/extras/8aab65fbfe2a3e6eeaf9c7dc1d50d0f8.mp4?t=1758676154\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > ~ ~\u00a0Roll through some delicious sweet locations ~ ~\u00a0</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The more you uncover while exploring Sarkara Island, the more mysteries you unlock: what\u2019s causing the devastating earthquakes? Who is the other O.H.N.O. official that has been sent to the island? And could the mythical Serenity Sweet, which everyone claims can make your dreams come true, really be somewhere on the island?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2269360?t=1758676154","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2269360/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1758676154","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2269360/40aa561675d27da9046c68d09117b449b89d656b/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1758676154","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2269360/40aa561675d27da9046c68d09117b449b89d656b/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1758676154","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An island made of candy sounds like paradise \u2013 but for the residents of Sarkara, fabled to be the home of the legendary Serenity Sweet, devastating earthquakes are threatening the resident\u2019s idyllic way of life!\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >YOU are an investigator sent to Sarkara to uncover what\u2019s threatening the island \u2013 and all of reality as we know it.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > ~ ~\u00a0Dress up in found objects. Reinvent yourself! ~ ~\u00a0</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You have lost all your stuff in a disastrous crash. Re-equip yourself with any item you find, from a doll\u2019s lost arm to a floaty feather. All can affect your dialogue skill checks and minigame moves. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2269360/extras/07b34ab87ef7b902431c9aa1f95df3ac.poster.avif?t=1758676154\" width=476 height=476 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2269360/extras/07b34ab87ef7b902431c9aa1f95df3ac.webm?t=1758676154\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2269360/extras/07b34ab87ef7b902431c9aa1f95df3ac.mp4?t=1758676154\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > ~ ~\u00a0Make friends with weirdos ~ ~\u00a0</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Get involved in local politics \u2013 or maybe accidentally join a cult. You'll have to form alliances and make enemies to get to the bottom of the mystery.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2269360/extras/931d7c91835d3ad705448c8c433b9e31.poster.avif?t=1758676154\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2269360/extras/931d7c91835d3ad705448c8c433b9e31.webm?t=1758676154\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2269360/extras/931d7c91835d3ad705448c8c433b9e31.mp4?t=1758676154\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > ~ ~\u00a0Get into various altercations ~ ~\u00a0</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When dialogue is not enough, settle disputes in minigames. Find limbs and candy that grant special moves to sway conflict in your favor.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2269360/extras/8aab65fbfe2a3e6eeaf9c7dc1d50d0f8.poster.avif?t=1758676154\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2269360/extras/8aab65fbfe2a3e6eeaf9c7dc1d50d0f8.webm?t=1758676154\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2269360/extras/8aab65fbfe2a3e6eeaf9c7dc1d50d0f8.mp4?t=1758676154\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > ~ ~\u00a0Roll through some delicious sweet locations ~ ~\u00a0</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The more you uncover while exploring Sarkara Island, the more mysteries you unlock: what\u2019s causing the devastating earthquakes? Who is the other O.H.N.O. official that has been sent to the island? And could the mythical Serenity Sweet, which everyone claims can make your dreams come true, really be somewhere on the island?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","developers":["Wirescribe Corp"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"RPG","id":"3"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2269360/fec8bf32d64312c288960c9d950e3691f3545504/header.jpg?t=1758676154","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires an Apple processor<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> Mac OS X 10.15<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel i5 Quad-Core, 2.7 GHz<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> GTX 660 / RX 460<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 3 GB available space</li></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires an Apple processor<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> Mac OS X 10.15<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> M1<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> M1<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 3 GB available space</li></ul>"},"name":"Unwound","package_groups":[],"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</stro